sp2-rs is an independent, unofficial re-implementation in Rust of the
inter-application texture sharing protocols used by Spout2 (Windows) and
Syphon (macOS). It does not include, link against, or redistribute source
code or binaries of either project. Protocol details (shared memory layouts,
kernel object names, notification names and message formats) were derived
from publicly available source code and documentation of the projects listed
below, whose copyright notices and license terms are reproduced here in
accordance with their respective licenses.

sp2-rs is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by the Spout project
(Lynn Jarvis / Leading Edge) or the Syphon project (Tom Butterworth & Anton
Marini). "Spout" and "Syphon" are names of their respective projects and are
used here only to describe compatibility.

